WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.399 --> 00:00:04.475
Choose Reinspect to open the reinspection worksheet.

2
00:00:04.475 --> 00:00:07.136
One item at a time shows each item in turn.

3
00:00:07.136 --> 00:00:10.526
Press 1 for Corrected. The next unanswered item opens.

4
00:00:10.526 --> 00:00:13.902
Press 2 for Progress made.

5
00:00:13.902 --> 00:00:18.717
Progress made needs a new due date for that item.

6
00:00:18.717 --> 00:00:25.012
Choose the follow-up, then the document, and Create draft.
